},"body":"<p data-local-id="3e608c1bfa7e">Hi Erik,</p><p data-local-id="aff3b41d143b">Thank you for reporting this and for the example receipts — they were very helpful in pinpointing the issue.</p><p data-local-id="be7a9723f3c7">We&#039;ve identified the root cause: a data-mapping issue affecting the item description field for line items on Cancel and Line Void transactions, which caused the description to display blank instead of the product name on the receipt.</p><p data-local-id="54350d963ab0">Our engineering team is actively working on a fix and we&#039;ll also be reviewing historical data to determine the right scope for correction. We&#039;ll follow up here with an update as soon as the fix is deployed and validated.</p><p data-local-id="8bf22968064e">Thank you for your patience.</p><p data-local-id="5466700c7939">Kind regards,<br>Diego Buelvas<br>Appriss Retail Support</p>","created":"2026-09-30T17:17:26.717-0400","updated":"2026-09-30T17:17:26.717-0400","updateAuthor":{"accountId":"712020:20065f69-a041-443a-8b58-b79b1649d0b4","displayName":"Diego Buelvas"},"jsdPublic":true},{"id":"3373358","author":{"accountId":"712020:20065f69-a041-443a-8b58-b79b1649d0b4","displayName":"Diego Buelvas"},"body":"<p data-local-id="cbddc24d1625">Hello Erik Figueroa,</p><p data-local-id="4e78dc9747a0">I wanted to share a quick update on this issue. Our Engineering team is actively investigating the issue and continuing work toward a resolution.</p><p data-local-id="92be6356ee34">At this time, we don’t have a confirmed ETA to share, but the ticket remains a priority and we’ll provide the next update as soon as we have new findings.</p><p data-local-id="78af0b37f6d0">If anything changes on your side (frequency, impact, new error messages, or steps to reproduce), please reply and share those details—they can help Engineering move faster.</p><p data-local-id="f64ce5c7ab2c">Thank you for your patience. </p>","created":"2026-09-30T17:17:39.688-0400","updated":"2026-09-30T17:17:39.68